{"resourceIdentifier":"5186","resourceName":"Quanzhou Canhua PET Recycling Project","description":"The Quanzhou Canhua PET Recycling Project (hereafter referred to as the project) aims to produce PET flakes by recycling and processing post-consumer PET bottles, thereby replacing the equivalent PET products produced from raw materials. The project has a processing capacity of 102,000 tons of waste PET per year, resulting in an annual production capacity of approximately 90,000 tons of recycled polyester (PET) flakes. The project is located in the Pu’an Industrial Area, Quangang District, Quanzhou City, Fujian Province, P.R.C.\r\nPrior to the project's implementation, the equivalent amount of PET flakes was produced using raw materials such as crude oil and natural gas. The project achieves GHG emission reductions by avoiding the consumption of these raw materials and by reducing related energy consumption.","location":{"latitude":25.134761,"longitude":118.905796},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-08-26","endExclusive":"2024-09-26","endInclusive":"2024-09-25"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5186"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Fujian Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Fujian Province Canhua Enviromental Material Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Fujian Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"5186"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"58574"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VMR0007"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}